Package: PhysioExperiment
Title: Unified Analysis of Physiological Signals (Meta-Package)
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Yusuke",
           family = "Matsui",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "mail.to.matsui@gmail.com")
Description: A meta-package for the Physio ecosystem: attaching it loads and
    re-exports the public API of the core packages (PhysioCore data model,
    PhysioIO file/database I/O, PhysioPreprocess signal preprocessing, and
    PhysioAnalysis time-frequency/connectivity/network/statistics/visualization),
    so existing code that used the former monolithic 'PhysioExperiment' package
    keeps working. It also provides the GUI/REST launchers. Domain packages
    (EEG, ECG, EMG, EDA, MoCap, cross-modal, MSK-Net, OpenSim, clinical) are
    installed separately from the same ecosystem.
Depends:
    R (>= 4.2),
    PhysioCore,
    PhysioIO,
    PhysioPreprocess,
    PhysioAnalysis
Imports:
    methods,
    utils
